cally or with a group of friends to enjoy Rodent Rampage. This demo comes with a lot of necessary tweaks, updates, and additions. Most notably we plan to add two new physics based throwables: Dynamite Ducky, and Nuclear D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-20T01:32:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365756197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253930-1825727806718725","game_id":"steam-4253930","kind":"announcement","title":"Third Beta Playtest","summary":"Our third Beta playtest for Rodent Rampage will begin Friday, March 6th at 5pm EST and end Saturday, March 8th at 11:59pm EST. Request access, wishlist, and bring your friends!We've made a bunch of updates to the game: NEW ARENA: Martian Arena!LOCAL Gamemode: Play locally against up to 7 different botsSCOREBOARD: Added polish, clarity, and character indicators in gameIMPROVED objective indicator in Golden Nut and King of the Molehill HUD Damage overly changesNEW character and announcer voicesNEW","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-02T21:42:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806718725","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253930-1823825466501933","game_id":"steam-4253930","kind":"announcement","title":"New Level, New Game Mode!","summary":"Patch Notes (Build 647)LevelsAdded the Playroom levelGameplayIncreased match size from 4 to 8 playersAdded the Golden Nut game mode.The King of the Molehill control area moves at regular intervals other areas of the levelBuffed Harriet’s minigun damageAdded unlimited Nitrous while Harriet’s special is activeRemoved Scrap’s ability to damage himself with his rail gunIncreased Chunk’s speed while his special ability is activeReduced Scrap’s railgun recharge timeGave Scrap a base amount of damage p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-07T16:39:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466501933","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253930-1822556746160305","game_id":"steam-4253930","kind":"announcement","title":"Second Beta Playtest","summary":"The next Beta playtest for Rodent Rampage will be Saturday, February 7 from 5pm to midnight EST.We've made a bunch of updates to the game, including a new level: The Playroom!Don't forget to request Playtest access and invite your friends. See you then!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-22T21:23:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746160305","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253930-1821922921817038","game_id":"steam-4253930","kind":"announcement","title":"First Beta Playtest","summary":"The first Beta playtest for Rodent Rampage will be this Saturday, January 17 from 5pm to midnight EST. Don't forget to request Playtest access and invite your friends. See you then!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-16T20:43:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921817038","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4253930-1821288646582865","game_id":"steam-4253930","kind":"announcement","title":"Rodent Rampage Steam Page Live!","summary":"We've just published the Rodent Rampage Steam Page and are accepting Playtest/Beta requests! We're getting close to an Early Access release where we'll get valuable community feedback to make Rodent Rampage the best it can be. First though, we plan to hold Beta playtest events where players can play matches with friends or match up with other players in the matchmaking queue. Our plan is to hold playtest events during a set window of time on the weekends. Our first Beta playtest will be held on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-10T14:10:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646582865","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4253930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4253930":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4253930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z"},"4874040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:49Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4253930","app_id":4253930,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7c992c83a614944964c58c97e7d9cd64c8efae6976716eccd25518e8aef3600a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Rodent Rampage is a third-person hero shooter. Combine nitrous boosted ground maneuvers, soda powered aerial attacks, and quirky in game power ups in a one-of-a-kind, PvP combat experience.","